# held-stories drives the validator under test and the sprint-status.sh reader it calls as a
# sibling, which resolves the sprint-status schema; every mutant copies all three. Its own directory
# is copied by the runner, and lib/ carries the mutant-kill helper it sources. The S-arms read the
# two prose carriers: implementation.md section 7 and the recover hook's verification turn.
!core/scripts/validate-held-stories.sh
!core/scripts/sprint-status.sh
!core/schemas/sprint-status.json
core/skills/ai-dlc/steps/implementation.md
core/hooks/ai-dlc-recover.sh
core/fixtures/lib/
